  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "ResourceManager is the central service managing the lifecycle, loading, and caching of all application assets, including textures, meshes, shaders, and models. It abstracts asset loading via a replaceable ResourceLoader, ensuring efficient reuse across the rendering engine. It maintains specialized caches for different asset types and handles context-specific resources like RenderTextures. The class provides methods for acquiring, loading, and disposing of resources based on their URI or configuration."
  },
